	<h2>Using ToolPulse</h2>
	<p>You may use ToolPulse for lawful personal or business purposes. You are responsible for the content you enter and for confirming that a tool's output is suitable for your intended use.</p>

	<h2>No professional advice</h2>
	<p>ToolPulse provides general-purpose utilities. Results are not legal, financial, medical, security, or other professional advice.</p>

	<h2>Availability and accuracy</h2>
	<p>Tools are provided on an "as available" basis. We aim for dependable results but cannot guarantee uninterrupted availability or that every output will meet every external standard or requirement.</p>

	<h2>Your data and devices</h2>
	<p>Use appropriate care with confidential information and maintain backups of important files. Browser-based processing does not replace your organization's security policies.</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>ToolPulse may update its tools and these terms as the service evolves. Continued use after an update means the revised terms apply.</p>
</InfoPage>
